    "closure": "exact initial x-leading factor census and bounded pseudo-remainder route cut",
    "statement": "For the F04 representatives over R02 and R20, the unresolved degree-12 resultant factor has x-degree 6 and the same irreducible nonnamed leading factor of total degree 6 in (s,p). The E2 leading coefficient factors as s times one irreducible nonnamed factor of degree 22 on R02 or degree 23 on R20. The E3 leading coefficient is irreducible and nonnamed of degree 23 on R02 or degree 24 on R20. Hence function-field division in x inverts genuine unproved branches and is not an exhaustive closure route. On R02, the first three content-primitive pseudo-remainder steps reduce x-degree only from 36 to 35 to 34 while growing from 12462/11316 input terms to 40921, 83811, and 149340 terms. No cell emptiness is claimed.",
